			"notes": "NEW UPDATE! including 1.21.11 alpha support. \n\n- **ShopHog** - hogs shop restock. \n- **AutoWelcome** - `/welcome` when an XI joins\n- **AutoJailVote** - votes for you. whitelist people you fw\n- **MathSolver** - highlights the drill answer\n- **Raycast Assist** - trajectory + range. the math is correct, housing is not correct because its borg 's outdated and inaccurate raycast code, please fix raycast and increase range to 20 blocks. \n- **Share** - boots / inventory / leaderboards, if you want\n- **Route Helper** - wolf / stargazer / wrongway / and more\n *warning some helpers: cannot be used while in air as to not affect your movement or parkour jumps*\n- **BorgRadar** - invisible borger23 in your walls? use wbutils for your home security.\n- **DamageDetector** - stop hitting yourself.\n- **Anti Anti Bank AFK** - jumps so the bank doesn't kick you *warning sometimes it does not work because housing does not register jumps sometimes for some reason*\n\n\n*\"please add the fix for the /shop in other houses, and add the proper wcr with cardinal lock\"*\n - mineguy\n\nDone and done. \n\n\nAuth can be reused across instances and versions \n/wbutils auth reuse\n\nAutobuy includes working speed 4\n \ni think i forgot a few. must have been a mistake.\n\nleaderboard tracking.\nhttps://wbutils.winss.xyz/lbdata.html\n\nagain, send any bugs over to me thanks"
